(We need to ensure compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha at goal. Initially we have candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha (so compliance certificate is linked to shift_candidate_alpha, not available). Goal requires compliance_certificate_available true. So we need to release the compliance certificate from shift_candidate_alpha. Use action release_compliance_certificate with parameters ?candidate - schedule_candidate ?compliance_certificate - compliance_certificate. We have shift_candidate_alpha as schedule_candidate. So we can release compliance_certificate_alpha from shift_candidate_alpha. That will make compliance_certificate_available true and remove candidate_compliance_certificate_linked.)
(Goal also requires compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha (yes). Also we might need to keep candidate_compliance_certificate_linked? Not required.)
