(Now we need dispatch_allocated origin_availability_alpha true (we will allocate via allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate). Also need candidate_vehicle_linked origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha (already true from init). candidate_dispatch_slot_linked origin_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha (we will set via allocate). Good.)
