(- Need dispatched destination_availability_alpha? Not in goal. So not needed.)
(- Need vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma: we will get from dispatching shift.)
(- Need vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha: from origin dispatch.)
(- Need dispatch_slot_available slot: after origin dispatch.)
(- Need dispatched shift_candidate_alpha: from early dispatch.)
(- Need dispatched origin_availability_alpha: from origin dispatch.)
(- Need dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha: from mark.)
(- Need dispatch_ready destination_availability_alpha: from mark.)
(- Need transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, transport_leg_loading_authorized: from assemble and authorize.)
(- Need origin_node_occupied, origin_node_ready: from load/unload origin.)
(- Need destination_node_occupied, destination_node_ready: from load/unload destination.)
