(- Need candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha? Initially true, but after we dispatch shift, we will have dispatched shift true, but candidate_dispatch_slot_linked remains? The execute_schedule_dispatch does not affect candidate_dispatch_slot_linked. So it remains true. Goal does not require it, fine.)
