(Now we need to ensure we have dispatch_allocated origin true from allocate; not removed elsewhere.)
(Now we need to ensure we have dispatch_ready origin and destination true from mark actions; not removed elsewhere.)
(Now we need to ensure we have dispatched origin and shift true from execute actions; not removed elsewhere.)
(Now we need to ensure we have candidate_dispatch_slot_linked origin dispatch_slot_alpha true from allocate; not removed elsewhere.)
(Now we need to ensure we have candidate_prepared origin and destination true from confirm actions; not removed elsewhere.)
(Now we need to ensure we have candidate_task_profile_linked destination route_task_profile_alpha true from final attach after authorize; not removed elsewhere (we will not detach). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure we have compliance_certificate_available true from release; not removed elsewhere.)
(Now we need to ensure we have vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha and vehicle_unit_gamma true from dispatch actions; not removed elsewhere.)
(Now we need to ensure we have dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha true after origin dispatch; not removed elsewhere.)
(Now we need to ensure we have origin_node_ready true from unload origin; not removed elsewhere.)
(Destination_node_ready true from unload destination.)
(Now we need to ensure we have origin_availability_node_linked and destination_availability_node_linked true from init; not removed.)
(Now we need to ensure we have candidate_vehicle_linked origin vehicle_unit_alpha true from init; not removed.)
(Candidate_vehicle_linked destination vehicle_unit_beta true from init.)
(Candidate_vehicle_linked shift vehicle_unit_gamma true from init.)
(Now we need to ensure we have vehicle_allocated origin, destination, shift true from init; not removed.)
(Now we need to ensure we have route_task_profile_available? Not needed in goal; after we attach destination final, it will become false. That's fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we have skill_certificate_available? Not needed.)
(Now we need to ensure we have equipment_available? Not needed.)
(Now we need to ensure we have operator_available? Not needed.)
(Now we need to ensure we have candidate_operator_linked? Not needed for goal.)
(Now we need to ensure we have candidate_loading_container_linked etc? Not needed.)
(Now we need to ensure we have candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha? Initially true; goal does not require.)
(Now we need to ensure we have dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha true; goal does not require.)
